vigilkit plugin-ps (GB28181 PS demuxer + source plugin)
Copyright 2026 vigilkit contributors

The PS (MPEG Program Stream) demuxer in this package is implemented from
ISO/IEC 13818-1 (MPEG-2 Systems) and GB/T 28181-2022 (公共安全视频监控联网
系统信息传输、交换、控制技术要求). It contains no third-party code.

